From 1ff1a86c71149252aa665eda2c34d44a8cfead3d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nikunj169 <nikunjmahajan9937@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 03:29:40 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Inji Certify rig integration, testrig image and report
 upload (WP-12)

- Inji Certify rig: OpenIDConformanceTest (one row per issuer module,
  TC_OIDF_CERTIFY_nn), the two conformance suite files and
  ConformanceRigRunner. The runner leaves out what InjiTestRunner does before
  any test that needs a full MOSIP deployment: health checker, Keycloak
  users, OTP listener and setup, partner setup, database cleanup. Of the
  per-row checks only the skip list and run scope apply.
- Bridge: RigRun.applyUploadSettings puts push-reports-to-s3 and the s3-*
  keys into apitest-commons' configuration. apitest-commons lets the
  environment replace only keys its property files have, and the rigs have
  none of these, so the upload never ran before (measured 2026-10-14).
- testrigs/build.sh: both shaded jars with the host's Maven (JDK 21 or
  newer), else in the maven:3.9.11-eclipse-temurin-21 image; --image builds
  ps01-harness/testrig:local from testrigs/Dockerfile (Temurin 21 JRE,
  Python 3 with the runner, both jars and suite files).
- testrigs/run-testrig.sh certify|verify --results FILE | --invoke: the rig
  in the image on the compose network, upload to MinIO when it runs.

Measured 2026-10-14 (stack certify or verify plus reports):
bash testrigs/build.sh --image: jars in 95 s (warm cache), image built
bash testrigs/run-testrig.sh certify --invoke: exit 0, report
  ..._T-15_P-3_S-0_F-0_I-3_KI-9.html; MinIO automationtests/injicertify/ lists it
bash testrigs/run-testrig.sh verify --invoke: exit 0, report
  ..._T-11_P-11_S-0_F-0_I-0_KI-0.html; MinIO automationtests/injiverify/ lists it
bash scripts/check.sh testrigs: PASS

Signed-off-by: nikunj169 <nikunjmahajan9937@gmail.com>
